@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #f7f7f4
  BorderColor #333333
  DiamondBackgroundColor #fff4e5
}

title 5GC factory SDLC: corpus in, limited NFs out

start

:1 Freeze scope\nNFs: NRF, AUSF, UDM, UDR\nC1 register and discover\nC2 5G AKA and UE registration\nout of scope written;

:2 Ingest\nOpenAPI YAML is the oracle\nnamed DOCX clauses only\nextracts then prompts\nnever the whole Rel 18;

while (7 Next NF to build?) is (yes)
  :this NF is NRF, then AUSF, UDM, UDR\ndiscovery between NFs only after\nNRF register and discover works;
  :3 Ollama writes development spec\nprocess, APIs, fields, out of scope;
  :HITL approve or edit spec;
  :4 Ollama draws diagrams\nsequence or C4 for this NF only;
  :HITL approve diagram;
  :5 Ollama writes Go\nlisten and GET health\nthen 3GPP ops on the same binary;
  :6 CI gate\ngo test, curl health, curl the ops;
endwhile (no)

:8 Factory workflow\nautomate steps 2 to 6\nnot before 3 to 6 worked by hand;

stop

legend
  Local LLM = Ollama. Human after every step.
  Sunny-day only: no heartbeat, TLS, PDU sessions.
  No LangGraph / orchestrator until step 8.
endlegend

@enduml
